-  meter reading, the pre-exposure it is divided by, the absolute illuminance that comes out, the
-  target EV that implies and the EV the camera settled on, plus the meter's saturation ceiling.
-  That is the line to screenshot if AUTO ever misbehaves; `docs/SceneReferredCalibration.md`
-  section 0 says how to read it.
+  meter reading. On the histogram meter those two lines are the **histogram itself**, drawn as a
+  64-character bar (one character per bin, log-scaled against its own peak) with the metering
